{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 62, :comments ["<b>And those counted of them were.</b> Those counted of the Levites in this number increased by seven hundred. The wonder is that no more than seven hundred was added to them, when Israel — those who died from age twenty years and upward — their number in the last count was close to the first count, for the Levites were not included among those counted of Israel. And the witness is Elazar the priest."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:35.200663390Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}